        {
            "CharacterId": 10070,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Mina_Growup_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0138/ch0138_growup_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "I feel like I've gotten stronger.\nIs this thanks to Sensei too?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10070,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Mina_Growup_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0138/ch0138_growup_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Today's me has grown further than yesterday's me. Hm, that's how it is."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10070,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Mina_Growup_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0138/ch0138_growup_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "Here's looking at you.\nWhy am I saying that in this situation?\n\nYou can't get something like that? Then well...\n\nSorry, I just got too into the mood and said it..!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10070,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Mina_Growup_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0138/ch0138_growup_4",
            "LocalizeEN": "Strength comes from having something to protect.\nAnd what is that? D-Don't ask me about every little thing!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10070,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Mina_Relationship_Up_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0138/ch0138_relationship_up_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "鳥をしとめる時は、慎重でなければならない。早すぎても、遅すぎてもならないのだ。\nなんで鳥かって……？さ、さあな……",
            "LocalizeEN": "Care is needed to shoot down birds.\nOne can neither be too quick nor to slow.\n\n..Why birds? I-I wonder..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10070,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Mina_Relationship_Up_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0138/ch0138_relationship_up_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "The end arrives suddenly, sparing not even us.\nUntil then, I want to us to be in tune with one another.\n\n...Yes! That was a good line if I say so myself!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10070,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Mina_Relationship_Up_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0138/ch0138_relationship_up_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "Let's get closer, a step at a time.\nThat way one day... what would happen?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10070,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Mina_Relationship_Up_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0138/ch0138_relationship_up_4",
            "LocalizeEN": "They say not to do things you're not used to, but they also say there's things you can't learn if you've never tried. Hmm.\nAh, Nevermind, forget it."
        }
    ]
}
